WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:02.774
This code cell contains several related helper

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.526
functions Even though they are shown in

00:00:05.553 --> 00:00:07.776
one interactive cell you can imagine that

00:00:07.803 --> 00:00:09.987
these functions live inside a small module

00:00:10.013 --> 00:00:13.000
called metrics tools dot P Y The

00:00:13.026 --> 00:00:16.263
first function is get profit It receives

00:00:16.289 --> 00:00:18.671
sales and costs and returns the difference

00:00:19.579 --> 00:00:21.855
The second function is get profit margin

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:24.487
Notice that it does not repeat the

00:00:24.513 --> 00:00:28.474
profit formula Instead it calls get profit

00:00:29.395 --> 00:00:31.329
This is good design because the profit

00:00:31.355 --> 00:00:34.605
calculation has one clear home The third

00:00:34.632 --> 00:00:37.934
function is format percent It receives a

00:00:37.947 --> 00:00:40.487
decimal value multiplies it by one hundred

00:00:40.697 --> 00:00:42.868
and formats the result with one decimal

00:00:42.895 --> 00:00:45.855
place followed by a percent sign Below

00:00:45.868 --> 00:00:48.158
the function definitions sales is set to

00:00:48.171 --> 00:00:50.197
twenty-five hundred and costs is set to

00:00:50.224 --> 00:00:53.882
eighteen hundred The program calculates profit and

00:00:53.908 --> 00:00:56.855
stores it in the variable profit It

00:00:56.882 --> 00:00:59.421
also calculates the profit margin and stores

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:02.487
it in the variable margin Before running

00:01:02.513 --> 00:01:04.737
the cell let us predict the result

00:01:05.658 --> 00:01:08.632
Twenty-five hundred minus eighteen hundred equals
seven

00:01:08.658 --> 00:01:11.776
hundred The profit margin is seven hundred

00:01:11.803 --> 00:01:14.382
divided by twenty-five hundred which is zero

00:01:14.408 --> 00:01:18.105
point twenty-eight or twenty-eight percent Click Run

00:01:18.118 --> 00:01:21.395
now The terminal should show Profit followed

00:01:21.421 --> 00:01:24.237
by seven hundred It should also show

00:01:24.263 --> 00:01:26.789
Profit margin followed by twenty-eight point zero

00:01:26.816 --> 00:01:30.132
percent Now change sales or costs and

00:01:30.158 --> 00:01:33.513
run the example again For example keep

00:01:33.539 --> 00:01:35.947
sales at twenty-five hundred but change costs

00:01:35.974 --> 00:01:39.066
to two thousand The profit becomes five

00:01:39.079 --> 00:01:41.421
hundred and the margin becomes twenty percent

00:01:42.342 --> 00:01:46.553
The important idea is organization Related helper

00:01:46.579 --> 00:01:48.421
functions can be placed together in a

00:01:48.447 --> 00:01:51.855
module Then the main analysis can focus

00:01:51.882 --> 00:01:53.763
on the data and the questions instead

00:01:53.776 --> 00:01:55.079
of repeating formulas
